@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Get every event: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events

### 2. Get event by ID: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/1

### 3. Missing ID: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/999

### 4. Search title: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?title=quiz

### 5. No matches: 200 []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?title=not-found

### 6. Create event: 201 (fresh run: ID 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Workshop",
  "location": "Room 105"
}

### 7. Update the created event: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/events/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Course",
  "location": "Room 106"
}

### 8. Verify update: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/4

### 9. Delete: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/events/4

### 10. Verify deletion: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/4

### 11. Update missing ID: 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/events/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unknown",
  "location": "Room 1"
}

### 12. Delete missing ID: 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/events/999

### 13. Invalid title: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "location": "Room 101"
}

### 14. Confirm there are still three events: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events

### 15. New ID must be 5: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AI Talk",
  "location": "Room 107"
}

### 16. Restart app before running: original three events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events
